<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Known issues: =
the first request after a swap sometimes takes four or five seconds because=
 the connection pool to the database is cold. We have a ticket open to add =
a warm-up endpoint that the swap can call. Until that is done, it is fine t=
o ignore a single slow request right after the swap, but anything longer is=
 worth investigating.</p>
<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>After the depl=
oyment, update the ticket with the build number and the time of the swap, p=
ost a short message in the release channel, and close the change request. I=
f anything went wrong, even if it was fixed, write two or three lines in th=
e deployment log page so the next person knows what to look out for.</p>
